     common subcommand-based interface.  The arguments to the tool specify, in
     this order: a set of common options that all the commands accept, a re‐
     quired _c_o_m_m_a_n_d name that specifies what kkyyuuaa should do, and a set of pos‐
     sibly-optional _c_o_m_m_a_n_d___o_p_t_i_o_n_s and _c_o_m_m_a_n_d___a_r_g_u_m_e_n_t_s that are specific to
     the chosen command.

